        "Description": "Good morning, 47.\r\rYour destination is the exclusive Gama facility, situated on a snowy mountain peak. We have sanctioned the assassination of three targets—individuals responsible for keeping the private hospital running for illicit operations and medical check-ups, and who have opened their doors to the world&apos;s most notorious criminal networks.\rWe must put a stop to this private hospital and make an example of it by eliminating three of the key figures involved.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
